      ],
      "text": "Mother:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " early-stage syphilis in preg: a single dose of benzathine penicillin G; PCN-allergic pts may be desensitized, then treated w penicillin; erythromycin = inadeq for mother and fetus; tetracycline = contraindicated."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
